      "writtenOn": "2020-07-17T03:50:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We will eventually stop using `prefer: true`. But I found that it\u0027s not the end of story because it still requires us to drop the name of the prebuilts from PRODUCT_PACKAGES and therefore define a new product target. What this change enables is to disable the prebuilts while keeping the same product target.\n\nFor example, \n\n$ choosecombo 1 blueline userdebug\n$ m  // this will install prebuilt APEXes\n$ OVERRIDE_TARGET_FLATTEN_APEX\u003dtrue m // this will disable prebuilt APEXes\n$ SANITIZE_TARGET\u003dhwaddress m // this will also disable prebuilt APEXes\n...",
      "parentUuid": "2aaf21d0_d4c7be54",
      "revId": "3fe1148370d6562c47a5eba221038563e76dff1f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
